<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>Godspeed full 360 degree change for instant steals for the game Locked on Roblox.
I suggest using a 0.5 sens with 1820x1900.
thanks to this macro u can steal the ball from anyone without having to rotate on ur own and it automatically locks in the player :D
this was the 4th part of the first form script btw have fun !!!
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
